t of\\nthe same mathematics is the Pic0Dimension/GroupSchemeHomogeneity pair. Do not price it as the\\nblocker.\\n\\nSEARCH DATUM worth reusing: mathlib v4.31 has NO functoriality for IsLocalRing.CotangentSpace\\n-- no map along a ring homomorphism of any kind. Transport a cotangent dimension via\\nSubmodule.spanFinrank (Ideal.spanRank_map_le both ways + antisymmetry, no Noetherian needed)\\nthen Nakayama. AJC's own spanFinrank_maximalIdeal_le_of_surjective is `private`.\\n\",\n      \"status\": \"pending\",\n      \"kind\": \"proof\",\n      \"priority\": \"normal\",\n      \"depends_on\": [],\n      \"inbox_refs\": [],\n      \"scope\": {\n        \"projects\": [\n          \"Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"parent\": \"AJC.pic0av\",\n      \"depth\": 0,\n      \"owner\": \"\",\n      \"milestone\": \"AJC.pic0av\",\n      \"pinned_commits\": [\n        \"b9bfa997f\",\n        \"b653ef4d6\",\n        \"6b1ed2604\"\n      ],\n      \"tree_depth\": 2\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"AJC.pic0av.properness\",\n      \"title\": \"Headline obligation 3: universal closedness of Pic0SchemeEt (the properness residue)\",\n      \"projects\": [\n        \"Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge\"\n      ],\n      \"summary\": \"Headline obligation 3: Pic0Et.universallyClosed (Pic0Et.lean:228, bare sorry). WORKED and RELEASED by ajc-p4 (run 0086 r3) with NO progress on the gate -- reported as a negative result, not as advancement. Owner cleared.\\n\\nWHAT LANDED: Picard/Pic0EtProperImage.lean, rooted, 9 declarations, sorry-free, all axiom-clean [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound] against Pic0Et.universallyClosed as a control that correctly fires sorryAx; lake build EXIT=0 (8629 jobs), lake env lean EXIT=0. Pinned 09f2106ffd (the correcting commit; the first revision reached HEAD at 2b59a2c5cc via another lane's integrate sweep).\\n\\nTHE ONE THING A NEXT LANE SHOULD TAKE, and it is a negative that saves a session: THE TOPOLOGICAL ROUTE IS DEAD AS A LOCALISA